<html xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
<head>
<title>ul has 40px start padding, 1em vertical margins and disc markers</title>
<meta name="assert" content="HTML 15.3.8: ul { display: block; margin-block: 1em; padding-inline-start: 40px; list-style-type: disc }."/>
</head>
<body><ul><li>one</li><li>two</li></ul>
</body>
</html>
